<apex:component controller="RegularRenewalDoc_Ctrl">
    <apex:attribute name="recordIdParam" description="" type="String" assignTo="{!recordId}" />
    <apex:stylesheet value="{!$Resource.PolicyDocumentsCSS}" />
    
    
    <!---ACH------------------------------------------------------------>
    <p class="heading"> 
        ACH (eCheck) - Payment Authorization Form 
    </p>
    
    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%">
        <tr>
            <td style="width:60%;" class="tableDataLeft">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Provide the information requested below.
                </p>
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Payment processed on date of receipt.
                </p>
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Payment Frequency: ___ Full Premium ___Quarterly ___Monthly
                </p>
            </td>
            
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;border:1px solid #89001a;">
                <p class="normalParagraph" style="color:#FF0000;">
                    Return this page by Fax or Mail ONLY
                    <br/>
                    Fax: {!$Organization.Fax}
                    <br/>
                    Mail: ISBA Mutual
                    <br/>
                    {!$Organization.Street}
                    {!$Organization.City}, {!$Organization.State} {!$Organization.PostalCode}
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p class="normalParagraph">
        <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Account__r.Name}</span> authorizes ISBA Mutual to charge its account, as indicated below, to discharge the above debt using installment payments in the amount and schedule indicated.
    </p>
    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%">
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Firm / Company Name <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Account__r.Name}</span>
                </p>
            </td>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Policy Number# <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;"> {!policy.Name} </span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Billing Address <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Account__r.BillingStreet}</span>
                </p>
            </td>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Phone# <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Account__r.Phone}</span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    City, State, Zip <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Account__r.BillingCity} , {!policy.Account__r.BillingState} {!policy.Account__r.BillingPostalCode}</span>
                </p>
            </td>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Email <span class="normalBoldParagraph" style="text-decoration: underline;">{!policy.Firm_Contact__r.Email}</span>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    
    <br/>
    <br/>
    
    <table style="width:100%;border:1px solid #000;" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Firm Name on Account ________________________________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Bank Name _________________________________________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Bank Routing Number _________________________________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Bank Account Number _________________________________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Bank City/State ______________________________________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    This Business Bank Account is Enabled for ACH Transactions ______ Yes ______ No
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    
    
    <table width="100%">
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Signature ____________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Date ________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:60%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Name _______________________________________________
                </p>
            </td>
            <td class="tableDataLeft" style="width:40%;">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    Title _________________________
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <p class="normalParagraph" style="font-size: 9pt;">
        I certify that I am an authorized representative of the Law Firm indicated above and that I have the authority to authorize these payments on the Law
        Firm's behalf. Law Firm understands that this authorization will remain in effect until the debt is fully discharged or it is canceled in writing whichever
        comes first, and Law Firm agrees to notify ISBA Mutual In writing of any changes in Its account information or termination of this authorization at least 15
        days prior to the next billing date. If the above noted payment date falls on a weekend or holiday, Law Firm understands that the payment may be
        executed on the next business day. Law Firm understands that because this is an electronic transaction, these funds may be withdrawn from its account
        as soon as the above noted periodic transaction dates and that it will have limited time to report and dispute errors. In the case the transaction is retuned
        for Non-Sufficient Funds (NSF), Law Firm understands that ISBA Mutual may at its discretion attempt to process the charge again within 30 days, and
        agrees to an additional $25.00 charge for each attempt returned NSF, which will be initiated as a separate transaction from the authorized payment. Law
        Firm has certified that the above business bank account is enabled for ACH transactions, and agrees to reimburse ISBA Mutual for all penalties and fees
        incurred as a result of Law Firm's bank rejecting ACH debits or credits as a result of the account not being property configured for ACH transactions.
        Both parties agree to be bound by NACHA Operating Rules as they pertain to this transaction. Law Firm acknowledges that the origination of ACH
        transactions to Its account must comply with the provisions of U.S. law. Law Firm agrees not to dispute these transactions with Its bank provided the
        transactions correspond to the terms indicated in this authorization form.
    </p>
    
    
    
    
    
    
